ki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Darkvision</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Darkvision+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Darkvision+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Drink to gain the ability to see in the dark up to 12 m / 40 ft.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Elixir_of_Darkvision\"> Condition: Elixir of Darkvision </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Darkvision_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision (Condition)\">Elixir of Darkvision</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens\" title=\"Essence of Crystalline Lens\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Crystalline_Lens\" title=\"Essence of Crystalline Lens\">Essence of Crystalline Lens</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crystalline_Lens\" title=\"Crystalline Lens\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/20px-Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/40px-Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png/20px-Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Crystalline_Lens_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crystalline_Lens\" title=\"Crystalline Lens\">Crystalline Lens</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Salt</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headl